240c8eca3ce22780cf3f5/ss_22f2eddfac02ebb1400240c8eca3ce22780cf3f5.600x338.jpg?t=1772457928"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/a94b77c3cb9a36e6de19232473a65bf0fcfa68b7/ss_a94b77c3cb9a36e6de19232473a65bf0fcfa68b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772457928","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/a94b77c3cb9a36e6de19232473a65bf0fcfa68b7/ss_a94b77c3cb9a36e6de19232473a65bf0fcfa68b7.600x338.jpg?t=1772457928"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/bc9b42095bb99a8d0ce428064240d93faee3c4ae/ss_bc9b42095bb99a8d0ce428064240d93faee3c4ae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772457928","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/bc9b42095bb99a8d0ce428064240d93faee3c4ae/ss_bc9b42095bb99a8d0ce428064240d93faee3c4ae.600x338.jpg?t=1772457928"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/3de9b6590734d98d845447b57cb42dd9dd5038e7/ss_3de9b6590734d98d845447b57cb42dd9dd5038e7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772457928","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/3de9b6590734d98d845447b57cb42dd9dd5038e7/ss_3de9b6590734d98d845447b57cb42dd9dd5038e7.600x338.jpg?t=1772457928"}],"short_description":"First-Person Survival Horror, 90\u2019s style. Hostile clowns lurk the woods. Fight-or-flight to uncover their gruesome secrets throughout a chilling Single-Player Story. Clever inventory management and resourcefulness are your only hopes to escape the Summer of 1999 alive.","steam_appid":3765700,"support_info":{"email":"ghostiegamesdev@proton.me","url":"https://www.ghostiegames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.ghostiegames.com/"}